 torey rental apartment building through a 1-storey podium. Together with t
 he existing building\, the proposal will result in a combined unit count o
 f 444 rental residential units. The Official Plan Amendment is required to
  redesignate the lands from Neighbourhoods to Apartment Neighbourhoods.\n\
