 tion Meetings\n\nThe City of Toronto’s Development Review Division has r
 eceived a Zoning By-law Amendment application to permit a 9-storey long-te
 rm care home with approximately 512 beds on the southern portion of the si
 te at 1020 McNicoll Avenue\, while retaining the existing building on the 
 northern portion of the site. The applicant intends to submit a severance 
 application under a separate process that intends to sever the vacant sout
 hern portion of the site\, which is the subject of the zoning application\
 , from the existing building on the north portion of the site. The applica
 tion proposes the following: Height: 9 Storeys Number of Beds: 512 Parking
  Spaces: 67 including 6 accessible spaces\; 78 bike parking.\n\nRegistrati
